Fix a crash, an `InvalidCastException`, on the binding guard of an `if case` whose condition Dafny splits, such as `case x :| B(x) || (A(x) && A(x + 1))`, in a lambda, a function body or a quantifier with a `let`, and a crash, a `NullReferenceException`, on a binding guard in a precondition that `{:autoReq}` copies, such as `requires (assert true by { if x :| P(x) { } } n >= 0)`
